{\Large Here Comes the Sun: The Effect of Earlier Sunrises and Sunsets on Academic Achievement}

\vspace{1cm}

Hannah M. Stackpole

California Polytechnic State University, San Luis Obispo

ECON 464: Senior Project

Spring 2026

